You rage coalesces at a single point, and then explodes outward, blasting enemies within a radius of [2, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] in all directions. The blast causes [184, 248, 297, 339, 376 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage and 2 knockback at the center, that decreases with distance. Anyone caught in the explosion will also be dazed for 3 turns.

In addition, your ability to channel force with this talent increases all critical damage by [4%, 7%, 10%, 12%, 15% (TL1-5)] (currently: 0%)

Damage increases with your Mindpower.
